## Runtime dependencies

This software invokes the following external tools as separate processes.
Their licenses apply to those tools independently and do not affect the
license of this software.

| Tool         | License        | Notes                                      |
|--------------|----------------|--------------------------------------------|
| bash         | GPL-2.0+       | Interpreter; not incorporated as source    |
| docker       | Apache-2.0     | Container runtime                          |
| curl         | curl (MIT-like)| HTTP client                                |
| awk          | GPL-3.0        | Text processing utility                    |
| sed          | GPL-3.0        | Text processing utility                    |
| envsubst     | GPL-3.0        | Part of gettext; template substitution     |
| openssl      | Apache-2.0     | Secret generation fallback                 |
| lsof / ss    | GPL / GPL-2.0  | Port availability probing                  |
| bats-core    | MIT            | Test framework (dev dependency only)       |
| shellcheck   | GPL-3.0        | Linter (dev dependency only)               |

Invoking a GPL-licensed binary as an external process does not make this
software a "derivative work" under the GPL. The MIT license of this software
is therefore compatible with all tools listed above.
